### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room (capacity <= 10 -> max 4h booking)
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Touching interval booking (R7 - expected: 201, also 2nd booking for ana on 2030-01-10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 8. R9: 3rd active booking on same UTC day for ana (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T15:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T16:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 9. R10: Create large room (capacity > 10 -> max 2h booking)
# @name createLargeRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conference Hall",
  "capacity": 20
}

###
@largeRoomId = {{createLargeRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 10. R10: Booking > 2h in large room (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "cristi",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-11T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 12
}

### 11. Cancel booking (R8 & R11 - expected: 204 if > 60 min in future)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 12. Cancel already cancelled booking (R8 - expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
